'''Empowering Howl''' is a [[warcry]]-like skill cast by [[Xoph's Favoured]]. This buff can be applied to the player when a Xoph's Favoured is raised as an allied [[spectre]], or using a {{il|Conversion Trap}}. The buff adds percentage of physical damage as extra fire damage. 

At max skill level when the monster is level 68 or above, the extra fire damage is 80% of the physical damage, according to datamined stats.

However, the spectre version of Xoph's Favoured uses a weaker version of the skill, which has another internal id: [[Skill:EmpoweringHowlSpectre|EmpoweringHowlSpectre]].<ref>[[Monster:Metadata/Monsters/Hellion/HellionBreachHowlSpectre]]</ref> The extra fire damage is 20% of the physical damage from this variant of buff.

